# SiteGuardVision

PPE (Personal Protective Equipment) detection web app using YOLO + Flask.

## Setup

    python -m venv .venv
    .\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
    pip install -r requirements.txt

## Model weights

Place your trained weights at `models/best.pt` (download link: ...).

## Run

    python server.py

Open http://127.0.0.1:5000/
